  "bodyMarkdown": "## Get down with JourneyLite in 2025!\n\nWhether it’s surgery, medications, or gastric balloon – JourneyLite is your trusted team to get your health back on track and the scale moving in the right direction in 2025!\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/new-years-semaglutide-special-at-journeylite/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n(https://journeylite.com/new-years-semaglutide-special-at-journeylite/) – You’ve heard about powerful new injectable weight loss medications known as GLP-1 receptor agonists. Start the year off right with a 3 month, all-inclusive semaglutide program for only $900. This includes medication, shipping cost, dietitian, and provider visits.  Virtual visits available!\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/gastric-balloon-surgery/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n(https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/gastric-balloon-surgery/) – Many patients don’t tolerate GLP-1’s but aren’t ready for surgery. The Spatz Gastric Balloon can be a great non-surgical, incisionless option. For a limited time, a complete Spatz program including insertion, removal, and office visits is only $6500!\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/self-pay-gastric-sleeve-only-10000/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n(https://journeylite.com/self-pay-gastric-sleeve-only-10000/) – If you’re ready for a permanent tool to help you lose the most weight and have the highest long-term success rate, a surgical procedure like a gastric sleeve could be for you. For a limited time, we are offering self-pay gastric sleeves at JourneyLite Surgery Center for only $10,000!",
